                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The dev has stated that it's deliberately hard, that it's not supposed to be a casual game... but that would have been nice to know pre-purchase.  It's cheap enough that I don't mind him getting whatever Steam passes through, but it's easy to get permanently stuck from a bad tech tree (upgrade) decision and then there's just no way forward.\n\nIf there was a trainer or even a walkthrough available, I'd probably feel quite differently, as the first 3 levels are promising, but I'm old & tired enough that I don't want to struggle with a game - it's just not fun anymore.",
